  <rms:rms_education_0_date>2026</rms:rms_education_0_date>
  <rms:rms_education_0_dateFormat>2006</rms:rms_education_0_dateFormat>
  <rms:rms_education_0_dateTS>1767225600</rms:rms_education_0_dateTS>
  <rms:rms_education_0_institution>California State University Fullerton</rms:rms_education_0_institution>
  <rms:rms_education_0_isGraduate>true</rms:rms_education_0_isGraduate>
  <rms:rms_education_0_location>USA</rms:rms_education_0_location>
  <rms:rms_education_0_qualification>Master of Science in Computer Science</rms:rms_education_0_qualification>
  <rms:rms_education_count>1</rms:rms_education_count>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_company>Cigna Healthcare Inc.</rms:rms_experience_0_company>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>January 2025</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>1735689600</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>Present</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_description>Developed and maintained a secure, HIPAA-compliant patient data ingestion system using Python, Django REST Framework, and FHIR standards, enabling real-time EHR access and reducing data retrieval latency by 30%.
Contributed to the implementation of a microservices-based architecture on AWS using S3, Lambda, EC2, and API Gateway, supporting 99.9% uptime and scalable access across 4 departments.
Automated healthcare claims validation workflows using Pandas, Scikit-learn, and business rules, achieving 96% accuracy and reducing manual effort by more than 115 hours per month.
Built a full-stack predictive analytics dashboard using Python, Flask, React, and Tableau, collaborating with data scientists and QA teams to analyze treatment outcomes and support a 15% reduction in patient readmission rates.
Supported the migration of over 5 million medical records from legacy systems to PostgreSQL, ensuring zero data loss and regulatory compliance through data validation, QA testing, and Pytest automation.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>true</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_location>USA</rms:rms_experience_0_location>
  <rms:rms_experience_0_role>Software Development Engineer</rms:rms_experience_0_role>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_company>Capgemini</rms:rms_experience_1_company>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>May 2021</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1619827200</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>December 2023</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1701388800</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_description>Developed and maintained backend services using Python, Django, and REST APIs to integrate patient health records with healthcare platforms, supporting reliable data synchronization across client-facing applications.
Contributed to a scalable microservices architecture using Docker and Kubernetes, improving system efficiency by 20% and reducing application downtime by 30%.
Collaborated with front-end teams to develop responsive user interfaces using React, Angular, HTML5, and CSS3, helping reduce UI-related bug tickets by 30%.
Participated in Agile sprint planning, code reviews, and cross-functional meetings, using JIRA, Confluence, and Bitbucket to support documentation, version control, and collaborative development workflows.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_location>India</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
  <rms:rms_experience_1_role>Python Developer</rms:rms_experience_1_role>
  <rms:rms_experience_count>2</rms:rms_experience_count>
  <rms:rms_involvement_count>0</rms:rms_involvement_count>
  <rms:rms_military_count>0</rms:rms_military_count>
  <rms:rms_project_0_description>Built a Python-based document intelligence platform using FastAPI, LangChain, Hugging Face Transformers, RAG, and Pinecone vector database, enabling semantic search and Q&amp;A over 10,000+ clinical documents with retrieval response time under 2 seconds. 
Developed REST APIs and microservices using FastAPI, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy, and PostgreSQL with JWT authentication, asynchronous programming, and OOP design patterns, supporting 500+ concurrent API requests with automated pytest test coverage. 
Used R for data analysis and validation of clinical document datasets to support evaluation of document processing and retrieval results.
Deployed the application as a containerized microservice using Docker, Kubernetes, AWS Lambda, and CI/CD with GitHub Actions, achieving 99% uptime and zero-downtime deployments with automated monitoring.</rms:rms_project_0_description>
  <rms:rms_project_0_title>Healthcare Document Intelligence Platform</rms:rms_project_0_title>
  <rms:rms_project_count>1</rms:rms_project_count>
  <rms:rms_publication_count>0</rms:rms_publication_count>
  <rms:rms_reference_count>0</rms:rms_reference_count>
  <rms:rms_research_count>0</rms:rms_research_count>
  <rms:rms_schema_details>https://github.com/rezi-io/resume-standard</rms:rms_schema_details>
  <rms:rms_skill_0_category>Programming Languages</rms:rms_skill_0_category>
  <rms:rms_skill_0_keywords>Python (3.x), JavaScript, R, Java, C, Erlang, Prolog
Python Libraries: Pandas, NumPy, SciPy, scikit-learn
Web &amp; API Development: Django, Flask, FastAPI, RESTful APIs, GraphQL, React.js, AngularJS, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap
Databases: MySQL, PostgreSQL, Microsoft SQL Server, SQLite, MongoDB, Oracle, ChromaDB
Cloud Platforms: AWS (EC2, S3, RDS), Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud Platform (GCP)
DevOps &amp; Infrastructure: Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, Terraform, Ansible
Version Control &amp; Collaboration: Git, Bitbucket, JIRA, Confluence
Data Visualization &amp; Tools: Tableau, HPQC, FuelTrak
IDEs &amp; Development Tools: VS Code, PyCharm, IntelliJ IDEA, Eclipse, Atom, Spyder
Methodologies: Agile, Scrum, Test-Driven Development (TDD)</rms:rms_skill_0_keywords>
  <rms:rms_skill_count>1</rms:rms_skill_count>
  <rms:rms_summary>Results-driven Python Developer with 4+ years of experience building scalable backend and full-stack applications using Python, Django, Flask, FastAPI, React, and REST APIs. Experienced in AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, microservices, database development, automation, and Agile delivery, with a strong focus on performance, reliability, and business impact.</rms:rms_summary>
  <rms:rms_teaching_count>0</rms:rms_teaching_count>
